        },
        {
          "text": "Kasimumtuma mundu jwaulesi kuti amtendele tusengo twine twakwe; tacimsakalisya mpela yila mwakusatendela mkamwa finyo jwamcesuce, soni mpela mulikusatendela lyosi m'meso.",
