              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakusayijembeceya ŵandu ŵambone kuti yitendekwe yikusayicisya lukondwa, nambo yakusayijembeceya ŵandu ŵakusakala yikusawila m'mandanda.",
